WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.130
End of the Second World War.

2
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:05.930
A German mother is held in
a Soviet camp in Ukraine.

3
00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.220
Her husband and children, back in Berlin,

4
00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:09.990
are searching for her.

5
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.120
Only the sick and the
pregnant are being released.

6
00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:15.840
She asks a guard to make her pregnant.

7
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.070
She is released and
reunited with her family.

8
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.870
Fletcher asks: did she do right?

9
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:25.360
Is doing the most loving
thing a guide anyone can use,

10
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.780
or does it ask too much of us?

11
00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:31.750
In this mission, you'll apply
Fletcher's method step by step.

12
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.120
Then you'll meet a Scottish
scholar's critique,

13
00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:35.890
and weigh both sides.

14
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:41.090
Your mission: weigh up whether love alone
is a guide ordinary people can follow.
